WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:08,090
You won't blame me for wasting your water, right?

2
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:14,920
A simple man enters a snake, and a snake enters a simple man. I have experienced this paradise-like safe house.

3
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:21,180
After experiencing the beauty of hot water washing over the body, who would want to go back outside in the ice and snow?

4
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,987
Take a seat

5
00:00:22,987 --> 00:00:24,795
listen

6
00:00:24,795 --> 00:00:30,216
I'll let you live in

7
00:00:30,216 --> 00:00:41,060
It's because you have some value to me

8
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:46,320
But you must always remember that this is my home and you can live in it.

9
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,320
It is my gift to you.
